        <message_html><![CDATA[<p>Dear ${customer.full_name},</p><p>To protect your account we have applied the action <strong>${card_action}</strong> to the card ending <strong>${transaction.card_last_four}</strong>.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="4"><tr><td><strong>Case reference</strong></td><td>${case_number}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Case type</strong></td><td>${case_type}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Status</strong></td><td>${case_status}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Expected resolution</strong></td><td>${expected_resolution_date}</td></tr></table><p>What this means for you:</p><ul><li><em>Temporary block</em> - the card cannot be used until we lift the block. Standing orders and direct debits are unaffected.</li><li><em>Permanent block</em> - the card is withdrawn from use and will not be reactivated.</li><li><em>Replacement issued</em> - a new card is on its way to your registered address and arrives within 5 working days.</li></ul><p>If you did not expect this action, contact us immediately quoting case ${case_number}.</p><p>Thank you,<br/>SafeTrace Fraud &amp; Dispute Resolution</p>]]></message_html>
